<title>UK: Brit Air evaluating ten new routes for summer 1997.</title>
<headline>Brit Air evaluating ten new routes for summer 1997.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brit Air of Morlaix, France, sales director Jean Bachelier said in a statement it is evaluating ten new routes for possible operations summer 1997.</p>
<p>Bachelier added it would also be stepping up its marketing in the United Kingdom. On Thursday November 28 Brit Air introduced a third daily service from London to Nantes.</p>
<p>- Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax+44 171 542 5017</p>
